     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\">The Alaska Department of Fish and Game, Division of Wildlife Conservation, is recruiting for a<span><b> </b></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\">Biometrician I/II/III</span></strong><span> </span>flexibly staffed position located in Fairbanks, Alaska.<span> </span><span><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" href=\"http://agency.governmentjobs.com/alaska/default.cfm?action=viewJob&amp;jobID=1026879&amp;hit_count=yes&amp;headerFooter=1&amp;promo=0&amp;transfer=0&amp;WDDXJobSearchParams=%3CwddxPacket%20version%3D%271%2E0%27%3E%3Cheader%2F%3E%3Cdata%3E%3Cstruct%3E%3Cvar%20name%3D%27CATEGORYID%27%3E%3Cstring%3E%3C%2Fstring%3E%3C%2Fvar%3E%3Cvar%20name%3D%27PROMOTIONALJOBS%27%3E%3Cstring%3E0%3C%2Fstring%3E%3C%2Fvar%3E%3Cvar%20name%3D%27TRANSFER%27%3E%3Cstring%3E0%3C%2Fstring%3E%3C%2Fvar%3E%3Cvar%20name%3D%27FIND_KEYWORD%27%3E%3Cstring%3E%3C%2Fstring%3E%3C%2Fvar%3E%3C%2Fstruct%3E%3C%2Fdata%3E%3C%2FwddxPacket%3E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://agency.governmentjobs.com/alaska/default.cfm?action%3DviewJob%26jobID%3D1026879%26hit_count%3Dyes%26headerFooter%3D1%26promo%3D0%26transfer%3D0%26WDDXJobSearchParams%3D%253CwddxPacket%2520version%253D%25271%252E0%2527%253E%253Cheader%252F%253E%253Cdata%253E%253Cstruct%253E%253Cvar%2520name%253D%2527CATEGORYID%2527%253E%253Cstring%253E%253C%252Fstring%253E%253C%252Fvar%253E%253Cvar%2520name%253D%2527PROMOTIONALJOBS%2527%253E%253Cstring%253E0%253C%252Fstring%253E%253C%252Fvar%253E%253Cvar%2520name%253D%2527TRANSFER%2527%253E%253Cstring%253E0%253C%252Fstring%253E%253C%252Fvar%253E%253Cvar%2520name%253D%2527FIND_KEYWORD%2527%253E%253Cstring%253E%253C%252Fstring%253E%253C%252Fvar%253E%253C%252Fstruct%253E%253C%252Fdata%253E%253C%252FwddxPacket%253E&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792453251664000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3bCDlGrBJFo1Ct87AkikKl\">Here is the link to the announcement.</a><span> </span></span></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><br><br><span style=\"background:white\">This position provides biometric and statistical assistance to mid and upper level wildlife biologists (Wildlife Biologist II, III, and IV) to support Wildlife Conservation staff and projects in the division’s Interior and Northeastern Arctic region (DWC Region III).  This position works closely with regional and area-based game management or research issues and offers a rare opportunity to provide biometric support to a diverse array of wildlife projects conducted in very beautiful and remote areas in interior and arctic Alaska.  Wildlife species include muskox, caribou, Dall sheep, moose, grizzly and black bears, as well as furbearers including marten, beaver, otter, red and arctic fox, wolves, wolverine and lynx.  The successful applicant will also have the opportunity to participate in wildlife field work with a variety of game species managed by Region III staff.<span> <u></u><u></u></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\">I appreciate any help you may provide in distributing this announcement to potential candidates for this position. We will be recruiting two positions from this applicant pool.<u></u><u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\">Please contact me if you have any questions regarding this position.<u></u><u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\">Thank you.<u></u><u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"background:white;color:black;font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif;font-size:14pt\">Scott Brainerd, Ph.D., C.W.B.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font:13px/normal arial,sans-serif;margin:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacin